{"type":"message","id":"25350326","parentId":"c540b906","timestamp":"2026-05-15T19:55:24.616Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 7:55 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 19:55 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778874924512}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e6834b2","parentId":"25350326","timestamp":"2026-05-15T19:55:28.422Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for recent messages in the arbitration and general threads, then respond if needed.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-44e65c88-9f4d-4825-b4d1-0605050f4e73","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ced99ccb-9922-4d8c-a4a0-a804eb9bf642","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X GET \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":185,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11308,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778874924617,"responseId":"chatcmpl-32669e77-296d-47ae-a8b2-4d88face9ec1"}}
